{"ASK_RIVER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"The river? oh no... don't -- there's something wrong with it, bodies, debris, I can't look","By boat? Where would you even find one... and the bridge, and whatever's on the other side","T-the Ohio's the edge of the world... I always thought, the end of the county, and now it's the end of everything","Water's water... I guess, but I wouldn't drink it, I wouldn't go near it","People tried, they took rowboats, canoes, anything that floated, I never saw them again!"}},
{"ASK_RIVER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"The river's guarded, by the Army, by the sheriff, by whoever's got the bigger gun","Boats were taken in the first week, and the ones left have no gas, or no oars","River crossing's a gamble, with the current, the cold, and the bullets","Fishing's good, though, catfish, bass, if you can stomach what they've been eating"}},
{"ASK_RIVER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Water's the highway now, if you've got a boat, a plan, and a prayer"}},
{"ASK_RIVER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Go swim, see how that goes!!","River's none of your concern"}},
{"ASK_RIVER","role=civilian_loner",{"I know the river, every bend, every shoal, I could take you across at night, for a price"}},
{"ASK_RIVER","role=worker",{"Barge traffic stopped on the fourth, and I saw one drifting empty, no lights, no crew"}},
{"ASK_RIVER","role=militia",{"River's patrolled, don't try, they shoot first"}},
{"ASK_RIVER","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"The river? Ohio's the edge, Army's got it sealed, boats shot on sight","Boats? Ha! You'd be a sitting duck, they've got machine guns on the bluffs","Swim it if you want, but the current's strong, and the other side is Indiana, not heaven","Nobody's crossing, kid, I saw a man try, he got halfway before they lit him up","River's full of bodies, I wouldn't drink that for a hundred bucks"}},
{"ASK_RIVER","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"The river? You can float on it, face down!"}},
{"ASK_RIVER","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"I'd give anything to cross it, my family's in Indiana, I think about them every night"}},
{"ASK_RIVER","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"River's blocked, patrol boats day and night","My cousin tried a canoe, they sank it with one shot","The river used to be where we fished, now it's a graveyard"}},
{"ASK_RIVER","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"The river? Go jump in it!"}},
{"ASK_RIVER","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Man, I wish it was an escape route, but it's a trap"}},
