{"ASK_RIVER","reg=club|st=neutral,careful|world=road",{"Used to ride along the river road, beautiful, now it's all roadblocks"}},
{"ASK_RIVER","reg=club|st=hostile",{"River's for fish and dead men!"}},
{"ASK_RIVER","reg=club|st=friendly",{"If you find a boat, {g:brother|sister}, let me know, I'll come with you"}},
