{"ASK_ROAD_SAFE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Safe? Nothing's safe, and the road's the worst, wide open, they see you for miles","I wouldn't -- I really wouldn't, I tried and almost died, twice!","The highway's a graveyard, bodies, wrecks, it's a nightmare","Y-you can try... but you'll regret it, you'll regret it as soon as you hear the first moan","Stay off the roads, cut through the fields, anywhere but the road","Safe?! Nothing's safe, nothing, I'd stay off the road if I were you","No, no, God, no, I saw things on the road, things I can't describe"}},
{"ASK_ROAD_SAFE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Roads are traps, they funnel everything, the dead, the raiders, the cold, avoid them","If you must, go at dawn, walk on the shoulder, and keep your ears open","Back roads are better, but still risky, you have to scout every mile","Highways are blocked... wrecks everywhere, no way through without making noise","The main roads are watched, by someone, always someone, don't trust them","Define safe, there's nothing on the road but trouble and more trouble","Go at dawn, go slow, stay off the shoulder, that's my advice"}},
{"ASK_ROAD_SAFE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Try it and see, I won't miss you","Safe for whom?","If it was safe I'd be on it instead of standing here talking to you"}},
