{"ASK_ROAD_SAFE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Safe? On the road? Ha! The only thing safe out there is the toll booth, and that's me","Roads are open, if you don't mind being robbed, shot, or eaten","Nothing's safe, {g:pal|lady}, least of all roads, that's where everybody gets caught","Highway's a graveyard, wrecks, bodies, nothing worth taking left","You can drive it, sure, if you've got a death wish and a full tank"}},
