{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Safe? Safe from WHAT? from them? from the living? from the cold? nowhere's safe, but some places are better","Try a cellar, with a lock, and a bucket, and a prayer, that's the best I can suggest","Somewhere high, upstairs, with the stairs blocked, somewhere with one way in!","I slept in a bathtub last night, with the door locked, and the radio on low, it was okay!","Where nobody knows you're there, that's the safest, it's the only safe","Don't ask me, I don't sleep, I sit up all night with a bat, so my advice isn't great"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Anywhere with thick walls, a heavy door, and a back exit, and a plan for each","I wouldn't count on one place staying safe. Have somewhere else in mind before you settle in","Somewhere you can see trouble coming and still get out. Don't trust height alone","Barns are decent, the loft, pull the ladder, stay quiet, sleep light","Churches are good, they were built to last, and they're quiet, and people leave them alone","Check how you'd get out before you settle in. A good hiding place can turn into a trap","Look for a place that's already been cleared, someone did the work for you"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"You can stay with us for a night, if you promise to leave at dawn, no hard feelings","I know a spot, it's quiet, but you've got to keep it to yourself, deal?","Stay close, I'll find us a spot"},false,false,{[3]={{t="you won't regret it",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Not telling, find your own","My spot's mine, it's not for sharing","Go on, find a ditch","There's no safe place for you here","Keep moving","Not telling!!","Safe places are for people I trust","You're standing in the safest place for you","No such thing","Don't know, and I wouldn't tell you if I did","I'm not showing you where I sleep - find your own","Anywhere away from me, that's safe for both of us"},false,false,{[6]={{t="find your own hole",afterMs=2800}},[8]={{t="somewhere far from me",afterMs=3000}},[9]={{t="not for you",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=civilian_loner",{"A hollow in the woods, a cave if you can find one, a rock overhang, nature's got better doors than people do","Treestand, off the ground, out of the reach, quiet, and a clear view, I've spent whole weeks in one"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=family_man,family_woman",{"We hold a house on the edge of town, you can stop for a quick rest, but don't make a habit of it"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=family_elder",{"My kitchen, honey, it's the only safe place I know, I've cooked three thousand meals there"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=family_youth",{"Under my bed, ha, I know, I'm a kid, but I've gone there three times, and it works"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=worker",{"Anywhere with a steel door, I'd say the plant, the garage, the warehouse, anywhere built like a fortress"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=rescue_medical",{"Anywhere clean, anywhere quiet, anywhere with a bed and a door that locks"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=rescue_clergy",{"The sanctuary, always, the walls are thick, the doors are old, the pews are hard, but it's safe"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=rescue_firefighter",{"The firehouse, if you can get in, the bay doors are thick, the roof is flat"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=militia",{"Our post, but we don't take outsiders, the numbers don't work"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Anywhere clean... anywhere quiet, anywhere with a door that locks and a floor you can sleep on..","You want safe? Find water and a bed and somebody you trust, then don't leave any of 'em","Not a hospital, God no, not a hospital, never again","One door, no windows, no carpet... something you can scrub and defend"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"There's no safe place for you, not from me, not from here"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"Come to ours, there's room, and I'll put in a word for you","There's a cellar by the church, with a lock only I have the key to, take it, hide there","Follow the creek north to the old stone barn -- nobody knows it, nobody goes, it's yours","I know a house on the hill, the owners left, the windows are boarded, it's quiet!","Try a school gym, the back door, say a friend sent you","An attic over a hardware store is solid, if the ladder is still there","Stay with my cousin on the north side, tell him I sent you, he'll feed you","If you hear whistling, three notes, that's us, follow it","There's a bunker behind the cemetery, an old root cellar, perfect!!","Come by sundown, knock twice, say your name, and wait","The fire station's loft is dry and quiet, tell them I said so","I'd offer my own home -- but it's full, so ask around for a friend of mine!","Take the key from under the third flowerpot, it's the cabin by the pond, make yourself at home","Funeral home's got a basement that's real comfortable, weird as that sounds!!","There's a spot in the woods, a hunting blind, with a view and a blanket","My sister's got a spare room, and a strong lock, tell her I sent you!!","It's not fancy, but the old rail depot has a stove and a roof","Go where the smoke is thin and the chimney's tall -- and ask for the old woman","You've done right by us, so we'll do right by you, come on in","The church has room, always has, always will, and you're welcome","It's no trouble to find, you'll see the smoke!","Look for the house with the swing set, tell them a friend sent you","Look for a red ribbon on a post, it ends somewhere safe","Safe? With us, that's my answer!","There's a cot in my place -- you can have it for the night, no questions","We share, we always share, and you've shared with us, so, come!","The library's back room has beds, and nobody to bother you","There's a key on a nail somewhere that opens a door you'll like","I can't promise perfect, but I can promise it's better than the ditch!"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best|hour=16,5",{"You can sleep at my place tonight, the couch is lumpy, but it's safe"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"Not here, not with us","There's a ditch down the road, try that","Safe for you? That's a joke","Find your own place, I had to","Nobody will take you in, not around here","There's an empty field, and that's it","You'll sleep where you've made your bed","No, no, no, a thousand times no","Try the wilderness, it doesn't know you yet","Safe places are for decent people","Sorry, I don't know of any, and I wouldn't tell you","Pick a tree, and climb it","Anywhere but here","You've burned too many bridges, so you'll have to cross the river","Don't look at me for shelter","The quarry might have an open hole for you","I hear the cold is bracing this time of year","You could try asking the people you wronged!","There's nothing safe for you, anywhere, I suspect","Just keep walking, you'll find a ditch eventually","I'd offer a blanket, but I don't!","If you find a safe place, don't TELL me where!","Hide wherever you can, I don't care","The woods are lovely this time of year, I HEAR!!","Not my problem, not my place, not my choice","I'd leave the county, if I were you","Sleep with one eye open, you'll need it!","Nowhere is safe from yourself"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst|hour=16,5",{"There's no shelter for people like you -- not tonight!"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Not here! not HERE! somewhere else, somewhere quiet","Anywhere away from this, anywhere","C-come on, come on, I know a place, nearby, nearby enough","N-not this spot... that's for sure, not this spot","We'll find one, we'll find one, just move","G-go... go, I'll follow"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=player_armed",{"Wherever you're standing, as long as you cover the door"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I slept in a church last night","Find a room with a lock and a window you can see out of, and not be seen through","The attic is good, if you can pull up the ladder","I like a storm cellar","Somewhere near water... but not too near","A barn loft","A school gym, if it's empty","Anywhere with two exits","A house on a hill","Bathrooms...","A truck bed under a tarp"},false,false,{[1]={{t="the doors were open",afterMs=3500},{t="the pews were hard, but it was quiet",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="nobody thinks of the attic",afterMs=3500}},[4]={{t="thick walls, one door",afterMs=3200},{t="and a bucket",afterMs=2800}},[5]={{t="water draws trouble",afterMs=3500}},[6]={{t="with the ladder pulled up and a pitchfork handy",afterMs=3200}},[7]={{t="big, echoey, bad for sleeping, good for hearing",afterMs=3500}},[8]={{t="that's all",afterMs=3200},{t="two exits and a bad temper",afterMs=2800}},[9]={{t="you can see them coming",afterMs=3500},{t="they can see you, too, so keep the lights off",afterMs=3000}},[10]={{t="small, windowless, sturdy doors",afterMs=3200}},[11]={{t="I've done it",afterMs=3500},{t="it works in a pinch",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"Safe? Ha","My mother-in-law's house","Safe? My mother-in-law's closet"},false,false,{[1]={{t="if you find one, send me a postcard",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="nothing would dare go near it",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="nobody's ever returned from it",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=civilian_loner|st=friendly,neutral",{"A hunting blind, up a tree","A cave with two mouths","A bluff with a view","An old fire tower, if it's still standing","A hollow log","Anywhere you can see them before they see you"},false,false,{[1]={{t="off the ground, off the trail",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="one to enter, one to run",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="and a rope to climb down",afterMs=3500}},[4]={{t="nobody climbs those stairs but me",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="don't laugh, I've slept in worse",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"Find your own hole","I don't tell folks where I sleep, there ain't a thing personal in that"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral",{"My cellar, dear","Church -- always church...","The kitchen"},false,false,{[1]={{t="cool, dark, with a good lock",afterMs=3500},{t="and enough jars to last a winter",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="that old building has withstood three floods and a tornado",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="nothing bad happens in a kitchen",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=family_elder|st=careful",{"Not here, {g:young man|young lady}"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"Under my bed","A closet with a lock","My treehouse"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I know, I know, I'm too old for that",afterMs=3200},{t="but it works",afterMs=2800}},[2]={{t="and a flashlight, and a bag of chips",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="nobody knows where it is",afterMs=3200},{t="except you now",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=family_youth|st=careful",{"No place for you"}},
