{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=worker|st=careful",{"Not for you"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=family_man,family_woman|st=friendly,neutral",{"Somewhere the children can sleep","A basement with a heavy door and a bucket and a blanket","A second floor, with the stairs blocked"},false,false,{[1]={{t="that's my only criterion..",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="and the window nailed",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=family_man,family_woman|st=careful",{"Not telling you where"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"The sanctuary, friend","A cemetery chapel..","The choir loft"},false,false,{[1]={{t="stone walls... heavy doors, a cellar..",afterMs=3500},{t="it has held for a hundred years",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="nobody visits the dead",afterMs=3200},{t="until they rise",afterMs=2800}},[3]={{t="narrow stairs, easy to defend",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=rescue_clergy|st=careful",{"Not here!"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Fire station","A water tower","A basement with two exits"},false,false,{[1]={{t="concrete floors, big doors, a pole to slide down if you have to",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="if you can climb it",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="one's never enough",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"High ground, with a view","A building with one door and a field of fire","A bunker"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and a ditch behind it",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="any bunker",afterMs=3200},{t="old root cellars work",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=militia|st=careful",{"Find your own"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"Somewhere with no windows","A closet! a bathroom! a hole in the ground! I don't care, anywhere!","Under something heavy"},false,false,{[1]={{t="somewhere with no sound",afterMs=3500},{t="somewhere I can't be found",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="a table, a bed, a pile of coats!!",afterMs=3200},{t="and then not breathing",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"Home was safe","There's no such place.."},false,false,{[1]={{t="until it wasn't...",afterMs=3500},{t="I keep looking for it",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="there's only the last place I was alive",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"Safe?! Nowhere's safe, they made sure of that, they locked us in with the monsters","Don't ask me about safe, I'm sick of hearing the word!!"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"You are, right now, with me"},false,false,{[1]={{t="that's the best I can offer",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Safe place? My place, for a price, you got anything worth trading?","There's a spot or two, but I'm not telling a stranger, think of it as professional courtesy","Somewhere to sleep? Underneath me, if you'd like","The safest place is wherever I am, because I'm the one with the gun","Safe? Used to be everywhere was, now nowhere is, deal with it"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"The safest place for you is far from me, so run!"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"I know a basement, strong door, it's saved my life, I'll show you if you promise to be quiet"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=raider_boss,gang_boss,biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"My people have a place, and you'll never see it"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Stay away from the main streets, there's a spot behind the laundromat, but it's ours","Safe? Nothing's safe, but the church basement ain't bad","I know a place, but I'm not showing it to you, you gotta earn trust"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Safe place? Not around us, there isn't"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Come with me, I'll find you somewhere, don't worry","Crash with us if you want, we don't bite - well, one guy does - kidding - you staying?"},false,{[2]="STAY_NIGHT"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Clubhouse is secure, but it's brothers only","There's a barn out on the county road, deserted, defensible, nobody's bothering it","Try the old fire tower, high ground, one way up"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Safe? Go find your own, we're full"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Stay with us a night, {g:brother|sister}, we will figure something out"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I can arrange accommodation, at a price","There are secured locations, I'd be happy to introduce you, with the right reference"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I know a place, quiet, discreet, my friend runs it"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"I sleep in the trees, away from everything","Somewhere with one door and no windows, that's the safest, I learned that the hard way","Nowhere's safe, I just keep moving"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Go away, find your own, I won't share!"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"There's a cave nearby, cold, but nobody's found it"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Cabin up the holler, nobody knows about it, I'd keep it that way","Hide in the woods, never use the same place twice","Old hunting blind I know, it's cramped, but it's hidden"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"There's room at my camp, if you're quiet and you share"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"Hide, and don't trust anybody in a uniform, I learned that the hard way"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"The courthouse is a designated shelter, check in with the deputies","Stay indoors with others, and keep the doors locked","We can escort you to a secure location, if you wish"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Return to your residence and stay inside, that's the safest place"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=law|st=friendly",{"Come with us, we'll make sure you're safe"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"The courthouse is the safest place in the county, which isn't saying much"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"All civilians are directed to shelter in place","Report to the designated staging area for processing"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Stay where you are, that is the safe place"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=military|st=friendly",{"I can recommend a place, give me a moment"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=soldier_nco|st=neutral,careful",{"Nowhere is safe, but anywhere with a wall is safer"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"Um, the base? Is the base safe? I thought so, but now I'm not sure"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=elite|st=neutral,careful",{"Don't stay in one place"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"A secure location costs money, and so does information about it"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Our farm's got room, but you'd have to work for it","Church on the hill has a strong cellar, check there"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Come stay with us, friend, we'll find you a place"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly",{"A safe place? I wish I knew, I've been looking for one for days, any lead, I'd take it","God, if I knew somewhere safe I'd be there, I'm not just standing here for fun","There's no such thing as safe, but some places are less awful than others","I heard of a place up north, but I don't know if it's real, rumors, you know?","Try somewhere with a lot of walls and not a lot of windows, that's my only advice"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly",{"Safe's relative, but high ground and one door you can lock helps","Somewhere with a roof, a floor, and no windows on the street side","I wouldn't sleep in a store, too many entrances, find a house with a basement","If a place smells wrong, leave it alone. I wouldn't sleep in there just because it's empty"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=careful,neutral",{"Figure it out yourself, I'm not your guide"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=family|st=friendly",{"Honey, I've got a little spare room, if you're desperate, but you'd have to share with the cat"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=law,swat|st=friendly",{"Stay off the main road, find somewhere with walls and just one door","We can offer a night, in a pinch, if you follow the rules"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=law,swat|st=careful,neutral",{"Not my problem, find your own"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=military,elite|st=friendly",{"Fortified buildings, avoid ground-floor windows, keep a watch rotation","Unknown, we move too much to know"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly",{"Ha, safe? There's no safe, kid, only less dead","Find a bar, drink until it doesn't matter"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Safe? Not near me, scram","Hole up anywhere you like, we'll find it"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=law,swat|st=careful",{"Not my business"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=military,elite|st=careful",{"That's classified, {sir}, whatever you are"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful",{"Everywhere's safe if you've got a gun"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Why would I tell you? You'd ruin it!","Not here - go"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=law,swat|st=hostile",{"Nowhere safe for the likes of you"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=military,elite|st=hostile",{"No safe zones for hostiles"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"There's a nice quiet grave just for you","There's a nice deep hole out back - real quiet"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly|hour=16,5|world=stairs,building",{"I'd want somewhere with a way out. We could look together, if you want company"},false,{[1]="STAY_NIGHT"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=stairs",{"Try the second floor of anything with stairs, take the bottom steps out if you can - my dad did it with a crowbar"}},
