{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral|world=generator",{"Clubhouse has a bar, a generator and fifteen armed men - safest place in the county if you're invited - you ain't"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=stairs,building",{"Upstairs with the stairs blocked, that's what I do, it ain't clever - it works"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=family|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral,friendly|world=door",{"Second floor, one door, something heavy against it - sleep with your boots on"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|world=door,window",{"Steel door, no windows on the ground floor - pump houses, cinder block sheds"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=rescue_firefighter|st=neutral,friendly|world=building",{"Not a basement, you get one way out of a basement, and that's the wrong number"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly",{"There's a room at the back of the church with a bolt on it - you'd be welcome"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"Sleep somewhere you can leave from - Comfort's got a body count now"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"Cells at the substation lock from outside - don't lock yourself in one - think it through"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Hardstand, two exits, sight line on the approach, missing one, keep walking"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=elite_delta|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Never twice, wherever you slept last night, somebody knows about it by now"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=club|st=neutral|world=door",{"Shop with a roll door and a grease pit - sleep in the pit, nobody ever looks down"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","role=crime_member|st=neutral|world=door",{"Storage unit - pull the door down from inside, hot as hell and nobody's ever come"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_PLACE","reg=raider,gang|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Safe place - sure, you tell me where it is and I'll tell you if it's safe"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"A safe zone? is there one? tell me there's one! a rumor, a place, anything?","They said the school gym, the church basement, the fairgrounds, but they all fell, one by one","Everybody says there's one and nobody knows where, it's \"that way,\" \"over there,\" \"my cousin heard\"","I'm still looking, I've been looking for days, and every time I find a safe place, it's... not","Somewhere, there has to be somewhere, I can't believe the whole world is like this","Someone on the radio said there's a camp in the next county, with a fence, and guards, and hot food","My home, my HOME was safe, until it wasn't, and now I don't know what the word means","Safe zone?! There's a safe zone?! Where?! Tell me, tell me, please","Oh God, I've been hoping for that, I don't know of one, do you? Do you know of one?","There's rumors, but rumors don't keep you alive, I wouldn't bet my life on one"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Safe? It's wherever fewer things went wrong than the last place, that's all I know","There were rumors of a camp, soldiers, a fence, a clinic, I went, it was a graveyard","You make your own safe zone, with locks and rules and a lot of luck","The only safe place is behind a closed door with a loaded gun and a quiet mind..","Folks have tried, folks have died, I won't send you to a lie","There's a few spots that hold, for a while, until the noise gets loud enough","They say the Army set one up, I say they say a lot of things","Safe zone, safe zone, that's all anyone talks about, nobody's seen it","If you find one, tell me, I'll follow you"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"The Guard said the shelters at the high school... the Red Cross cots and everything, we're heading there now","Evacuation centers, they said, I have the address, I don't trust it, but I have it"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Like I'd tell you if I knew!","Safe from what? from you? yeah, that'd be nice","Ask someone else","If there was somewhere safe, why would I tell a stranger? Keep walking","Safe from what? From you? That's what I'm still trying to work out"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","role=militia",{"Our post is safe enough, but not for everyone, we can't take in refugees, the numbers don't work.."}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","role=rescue_medical",{"There's no safe place for the sick... so I stay with them, wherever they are"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","role=rescue_clergy",{"The church is a sanctuary, open to all, and I won't turn anyone away, but I can't promise it will hold"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","role=civilian_loner",{"Safe? Out here nothing is... but some places are quieter than others"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"Everyone says the shelters are safe, the school gyms, the churches, the fire halls","They'll set up a zone, a proper one, with tents, and hot soup"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,14",{"The camps are failing, I've heard","There was a zone, supposedly, but it fell in the first week"},false,false,{[1]={{t="some are overrun",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=15,99999",{"There's no safe zone","Whatever safe zones there were are long gone"},false,false,{[1]={{t="only safer ones",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"Is there? is there?! tell me! tell me where!"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"We had one, once"},false,false,{[1]={{t="a house, a family, a table",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"They promised us safe zones, then they locked the gates!"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"You're my safe zone, right now, don't laugh, I mean it"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Safe zone? The only safe place is behind my gun, and I'm not sharing","There's no such thing, anybody who tells you different is selling you something","I heard the Army's got a camp up north, but I also heard it's full of dead people, so which is it?","Somewhere out there maybe, I haven't found it, and I've looked","Safe? Nothing's safe, {g:pal|lady}, what planet are you living on?","Some guy told me there's a church in Rosewood that takes people in, I laughed in his face","They keep saying \"safe zone\", I keep saying \"show me\", nobody's ever shown me"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"You want safe? I can make you safe, six feet under!","Safe zone's wherever I say it is, and you're not in it!"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"God, I'd love to know... if you hear of one, come tell me, okay? I'll make it worth your while","I wish there was one, honestly, I'm so tired of looking over my shoulder"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","role=raider_boss,gang_boss,biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"Safe is a luxury, and I own all the luxury around here"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Nowhere's safe, not anymore","My block was safe until Friday, now it's a graveyard","I heard some kind of camp at the stadium, but you can't believe everything you hear","Some preacher says the church on the corner is safe, I'm not about to test it"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"There's no safe zone for people like you"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"If you find one, come back and tell us, {g:man|lady}, I'd follow you there in a heartbeat"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Ain't no safe place, {g:brother|sister}, just places that are less bad","There's a quarry north of town, high ground, one way in, it was fine last I looked","Clubhouse is the safest place I know, but I can't let you in"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Safe? Not for you"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Stick with us, friend, we'll find somewhere, I promise"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Safe costs money, same as everything else","I could point you to a few places, for a price","Some places less bad than others, none of 'em safe"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I know a spot, off the main road, if you're willing to trade"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Safe? Haha, nothing's safe, they made sure of that","Outside is safer than inside, that's all I know","Somewhere with no windows and one door, that's the safest, I learned that the hard way"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"There is no safe zone! Stop asking!"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"If there was one, I'd have found it already, believe me, I've been looking"}},
